/cpython/git/trees/2196d07ad6875f6fd3ec32be3d06c4af06dbf0cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/git/commits/d4a8066c82a9b71c26d98c285db233fe2ef07517","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIdjcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2YkQAIWZ1Ud59VJ5mBaBsrhsgG/k\nZGRu0sWnb6/HVeSnBr5J08yClvwD2Ftrhb2zM3I7NHoDpVv3ksZRoEgQss3zjXpL\nmksJ0j/ZulUlTsDIzqUgaprA9DTC8dZF0GZbmmn1x2YRWpZoEC7k1WZYZJM8c/0+\nBJqPRgYF5/4zqHt+8kLngYBitYU7b3IBSQnrN1OtRpV4kgKTZN9EMNsKOkYQXiE7\nQMWkmSxAfl9oqGJGKT1rRknbMOs+iSTPbqRUXCavy25zL/+atBULfQ9I5Z4wFbQ3\nWb3ofyAWarGEU2c+zu4skBbj+pTW8vIRjOWpcOBoI+ZytvAqrLfoWD8TMsqElQ2i\nXpnR17U4be5RiJsP/q9kn8uNhco3aCde1EF7donwuSBtbr8Nl2JnPx8rWa3u4+a3\nQKQefTsWC+Jg9sy/oKIgJR2sJvrK517b9OJu5x/STr3NANjxPEe9KqJaNPKZ5JfE\nYvpOpgkzv/7SAjUEff91WLJ8uNkER10OCUbn0Tqyo9/nF5PeTWOnSqPFk2GJhV7H\nieBDVQ0mvAHjrv5QWH42niz3MMBAVPoDGx9nK9Zmqix+HQ26TUuP5ZNuNjFLDOYL\n8F7+RfbSyyPzqL3gFx9VCelCk7U1R2QHobLYeIVJValKJum52iYJ/Ao+GFsLqx0x\ntnsIdadgnj+ed9oeHqKe\n=1I+U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 2196d07ad6875f6fd3ec32be3d06c4af06dbf0cf\nparent e833f57383546a02d61028aa87194aa65d5a92a3\nauthor Bernát Gábor <gaborjbernat@gmail.com> 1780603100 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780603100 -0700\n\ngh-150817: Speed up Flag bitwise operations (GH-150824)\n\nFlag.__or__, __and__ and __xor__ walked both operands on every call to reject\nNone values. Run that scan only when one of the operand values is actually\nNone, so valid combinations skip it. The TypeError and its message are\nunchanged for the invalid cases.","verified_at":"2026-06-04T19:58:21Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/commits/d4a8066c82a9b71c26d98c285db233fe2ef07517","html_url":"https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/d4a8066c82a9b71c26d98c285db233fe2ef07517","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/commits/d4a8066c82a9b71c26d98c285db233fe2ef07517/comments","author":{"login":"gaborbernat",